*.p12
*.p8
*.cer
cert.b64

# Staged sidecar binary (regenerated from `cargo build --bin record`)
/src-tauri/binaries/

# Icon generation source (regenerate with: tauri icon <src>)
/app-icon.png

# Untracked launch working docs
/LAUNCH-PLAN.md
/DRAFTS-community.md

# Local audit notes — kept out of the repo on purpose.
AUDITORIA-*.md
